Frightened Khara meets Rāma like Namuchi meeting Indra --- Both fill sky with arrows hiding the sun --- Khara cuts Rāma bow and fells sunlike armor --- Rāma lifts great Vaiṣṇava bow for Khara death --- Rāma shatters banner horses driver chariot and bow --- Rāma plants six aimed arrows in head arms chest --- Thirteen sunlike shafts strip chariot and pierce Khara --- Chariotless Khara leaps down grasping mace --- Gods and sages applaud Rāma from sky cars